1298..1376 Comment "/// A buffer moved into the mock kernel\'s submission and finished there before"
1377..1453 Comment "/// the completion is posted: the send consumes the submitter\'s end, and the"
1454..1511 Comment "/// kernel\'s receive binds it until the kernel closes it."
